"Pgm.skel":

	This file contains the list of section headings that the program
	"imtoum" expects an IPW program to have.


"Lib.skel":

	This file contains the list of section headings for an IPW library
	function; this list is based on the list of headings for IPW programs
	so that the program "imtoum" can be easily modified to handle
	library functions as well.

5/95, J. Domingo
